  "question": {
    "text": "The total number of irrational terms in the binomial expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>7</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>60</mn></msup></math> is"
  },
